Keep the signing comparison failure while running the remaining regression tests.

The platform's host-dependent byte comparison exits before container, fixup, TLS,
keyboard, drawing, event, crypto and cloud tests. A known-failure classification
must not turn those unexecuted tests into a full-suite pass. Preserve the signer
exit status and return it only after the rest of the suite has run. Any other
failure still stops the suite normally.

